# Version: 0.2.0 | 2026-11-02
Fixture conventions

lint_blocklist.txt: UTF-8; ignore blank lines and # comments. C-8 terms are
verbatim. The three C-9 phrases were selected under the user's authorization
recorded in docs/implementation_decisions.md.

Playable state is created only by Engine.dispatch. tests/harness.py and recorded
command journeys establish it without debug/state-setting verbs. Synthetic
primitive envelopes in platform unit tests are not playable game fixtures.

The four primary golden scripts have fixed RNG and event-stream hashes and run
three times each. advanced_training.txt starts fresh, completes the campaign,
recruits new members, earns additional combat XP, pays for level/skill training,
and learns every ordinary feat. It is a command recording, not a saved snapshot.
